          <p>
            Two notes on the Clean Simple Eats column. The brand prints total sugars and dietary fiber as "less than 1 g," so our database leaves those fields blank rather than guessing. The ingredient list is grass-fed whey protein isolate, cocoa powder, natural flavors, sea salt, coconut milk powder and stevia leaf extract, with the 100 mg enzyme blend on the panel; the label declares only milk as an allergen, but if you avoid coconut, note that it is there. We could not find the bag's net weight printed in text.
